# RUN: %t.native
# The mapping budget is compile wall time, not an acceptance threshold. Under
# the declared-work bound each software plan runs its whole configured search,
# and this row's declared work was measured well above the fast tier; the
# budget follows that measurement and shrinks as the closure cost falls.
# RUN: env LOOM_VERBOSE_LEVEL=1 %loom-cc %loom-product-acceleration-profile -std=c11 -O1 -ffp-contract=off \
